70 points is 7 magic missiles.  In vanilla, this is enormous since each
magic missile does d(ridiculous) damage, plus any bounces off a wall
behind the critter, and totally unreduced unless the critter has MR.

I changed gain energy this morning in Spork to be either 1-75 (for
uncursed) or 75-150 (for blessed), with no alteration to the "max
energy" effect.  We'll see how that goes; it should certainly make it
more tempting than "oh, cool, gain energy; save that for alchemy!"

